{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I'd like to go first. I received the finalized quarter-end audit note this morning, and it shows that the legally distributable reserves available for this special dividend are exactly $5,700,000 — not the $8,000,000 figure in the internal draft. This note has not yet been circulated to the committee. Since our policy sets the dividend at the maximum legally distributable amount identified by financial control, this figure should be the basis for our decision."}
```

